Source: iron-proxy
Section: misc
Maintainer: Local Builder <builder@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl
Homepage: https://github.com/paradigmxyz/iron-proxy

Package: iron-proxy
Architecture: amd64
Description: Egress firewall for untrusted workloads.
 iron-proxy is a MITM egress proxy with a built-in DNS server that sits
 between untrusted workloads and the internet. It enforces default-deny
 egress, injects real secrets at the boundary in place of proxy tokens,
 and logs every request as structured JSON.
